      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROCKY ROCKS (2) was far from disgraced when midfield from a wider draw in a Vicbred heat last week. Had been racing well with a string of wins and placings prior, getting within 1.4m of the smart Enjoy Life in the Tasmanian Derby two back. That form reads well for this. LOUGLE (7) is racing well having placed in all three starts here since a spell. Draws wide but should be close to his peak and is suited up to a distance where he has recorded two wins and four placings in six attempts. FOURTH RESPONSE (6) brings good form from Tasmania where he has won two of his last three starts and he strikes at 50 per cent at this distance. HITCH TO HIS STAR (4) draws lower than last start and had put together a series of top-four results prior.",
